# Used with: scripts/e2e.sh tests/e2e/links.actions -- target/debug/temzdf standalone pdf --clean target/fixtures/sample.pdf
# Coordinates assume the default 900x600 window (fit width, page 1 at the top).
# Judged (expect): clicking "3 Filler" in the table of contents jumps to
# section 3 on page 2 (clicked); Backspace (or Ctrl-o) returns to the table of
# contents (back); Alt+Right goes forward again (forward).
pause 1
click 160 412
pause 1
expect clicked
keys BackSpace
pause 1
expect back
keys alt+Right
pause 1
expect forward
